       perhaps targeted at development for embedded Linux systems.  Among such
       libraries  are  _u_C_l_i_b_c  ⟨http://www.uclibc.org/⟩,  _d_i_e_t_l_i_b_c ⟨http://www
       .fefe.de/dietlibc/⟩, and _m_u_s_l  _l_i_b_c  ⟨http://www.musl-libc.org/⟩.   De‐
       tails  of  these  libraries are covered by the _m_a_n_‐_p_a_g_e_s project, where
       they are known.

